' Source: apps/api-node/src/modules/matching/application/matching.use-cases.ts
' Main entity migration: apps/api-node/src/migrations/002_lost_found_schema.sql
' One-table abstraction: related repository reads/writes stay inside the service.
actor "System" as Actor
participant "Post Change Task" as Page
participant "Matching Service" as Service
participant "match_results" as Table <<entity>>

Actor -> Page: 1: runForPost(postId) after committed post change
activate Page
Page -> Service: 2: Run task with current eligible context
activate Service
Service -> Service: 3: Receive committed create/update event; resolve active source
Service -> Service: 4: Load candidates; score using configured hybrid engine
Service -> Table: 5: Persist calculated matches for eligible source
activate Table
Table --> Service: 6: Updated source match projection
deactivate Table
alt Matching refresh succeeds
Service -> Service: 7: Record best-effort refresh outcome
Service --> Page: 8: Refresh completed
Page --> Actor: 9: Record task outcome
else Matching fails after post commit
Service -> Service: 7.1: Log refresh failure; do not undo the valid post
Service -> Service: 7.2: Keep committed post; report refresh failure
Service --> Page: 7.3: Task not completed; bounded retry / report failure
Page --> Actor: 7.4: Record failure without reporting success
end
deactivate Service
deactivate Page

legend left
Scope: Best-effort post-change matching is not a transaction with the post write.
endlegend
@enduml
